{
    "_comment": [
        "Maps every raw Jolpica/Ergast result status to a small vocabulary.",
        "outcome comes from positionText first (digits, R, N, W, F, D, E) and",
        "falls back to the status group below; cause only applies to retirements.",
        "Statuses matching lappedPattern ('+1 Lap', '+2 Laps', ...) are lapped.",
        "A status missing from this file is treated as a retirement with cause",
        "'unknown' and listed in v2/coverage.json so it can be added here."
